  "id": "adjunctive-therapy",
  "term": "adjunctive therapy",
  "definition": "Adjunctive therapy is a treatment added to a main treatment rather than used by itself. In this context, it refers to using another medication alongside an antidepressant to try to improve depression symptoms.",
