      "reasons": [
        "The packet supports adjunctive use as adding another medication alongside antidepressants (e.g., empagliflozin alongside citalopram), but it does not explicitly support the definitional claim that adjunctive therapy is used “rather than used by itself.”",
        "Because that specific contrast (“instead of using it by itself”) is not directly supported in the provided text, the definition contains an unsupported substantive element."
